{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your band, unlock powerful relics, and slay hordes in sync with the beat. Big Band Survivors is a rhythm-based roguelite that combines the visceral gameplay of the Survivors-like genre with musically interwoven game mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udce2Join our <strong>official Discord server!</strong> Get access to dev logs from the team, big game announcements and exciting previews - or just hang with the community! Find the invite link in the <strong>panel to the right,</strong> here on our Steam page\ud83d\ude0a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213230/extras/f31b3b0de61f0481687809d2cf244e39.avif?t=1760461676\" data-has-big width=800 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Big Band Survivors</strong> everything <strong>adapts dynamically to the music </strong>so you can slay aliens to the beat, but the music also changes depending on choices you make in game. Combined with the roguelite format it means that each run is not only <strong>unique mechanically</strong>, but also <strong>unique in its soundscape</strong>, allowing for twofold player expression in every choice made. Thematically, you play as a human musician battling hordes of strange aliens in various arenas, designed by the alien orchestrators as a gladiatorial spectator sport.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213230/extras/2e289e55d170f3e24aada96da7b8fd1f.poster.avif?t=1760461676\" width=674 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213230/extras/2e289e55d170f3e24aada96da7b8fd1f.webm?t=1760461676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213230/extras/2e289e55d170f3e24aada96da7b8fd1f.mp4?t=1760461676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213230/extras/8a2ac7051c5a2178d7bc617c67182864.avif?t=1760461676\" data-has-big width=800 height=56 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a run you will find yourself <strong>fighting the aliens</strong> to collect experience in order to <strong>level up your character</strong>. Doing so will let you <strong>pick new instruments for your ensemble</strong> or upgrade the ones you already have which both gives you new or better attacks but also <strong>affects the music being played</strong>. Keep an eye out for care packages sent by adoring fans as they can give you just what you need in a given moment, but be careful to stay clear of their landing zone. Additionally you will be rewarded with a relic each time you defeat one of the game\u2019s bosses, which grant strong and often synergistic new abilities to the player character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213230/extras/506aca9de7f0143c841e37280d4a8adb.poster.avif?t=1760461676\" width=680 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213230/extras/506aca9de7f0143c841e37280d4a8adb.webm?t=1760461676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213230/extras/506aca9de7f0143c841e37280d4a8adb.mp4?t=1760461676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213230/extras/e2aa461115563df17c9cda17e1779240.avif?t=1760461676\" data-has-big width=800 height=56 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each run, win or lose, you will be awarded with roses from the fans depending on your performance. These roses can be spent between runs on <strong>powerful upgrades</strong> that will help you survive longer on future attempts. There are also plenty of <strong>achievements with a variety of exciting rewards</strong> for you to try and get.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213230/extras/100d4fe136f5e472e22edcec6ae480f5.poster.avif?t=1760461676\" width=800 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213230/extras/100d4fe136f5e472e22edcec6ae480f5.webm?t=1760461676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213230/extras/100d4fe136f5e472e22edcec6ae480f5.mp4?t=1760461676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3213230?t=1760461676","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213230/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760461676","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213230/aef011c74d0914074a48047f80f5fbe8990572e0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760461676","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213230/aef011c74d0914074a48047f80f5fbe8990572e0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760461676","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4046800,"description